    metaDescription: 'Home loan insurance covers your mortgage repayments if illness, accident, or redundancy strikes. Compare NZ providers including AIA, Partners Life, and Fidelity Life.',
    heroImage: 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1579621970563-ebec7560ff3e?w=1200&q=80',
